# Written by the NEREUS setup screen.
#
# Boundary and region lines are applied in order and the LAST match wins, which
# is what resolves the corners. Put a moving lid last to have it beat the side
# walls; put no-slip walls last to have them beat an inlet.

sampling center

boundary xmin freeslip
boundary xmax freeslip
boundary ymin freeslip
boundary ymax freeslip
boundary zmin freeslip
boundary zmax freeslip

initial u="sin(x)*cos(y)*cos(z)" v="-cos(x)*sin(y)*cos(z)" w="0"

force u="0.6*sin(x)*cos(y)*cos(z)*(1+0.5*cos(0.5*t))" v="-0.6*cos(x)*sin(y)*cos(z)*(1+0.5*cos(0.5*t))" w="0"
